  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "たいかくは　こがらだが　カイリキーや\nハリテヤマなど　おおきな　ポケモンと\nごかくに　たたかう　テクニシャン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "체격은 작지만 괴력몬이나\n하리뭉 등의 커다란 포켓몬과\n막상막하로 싸우는 테크니션이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Malgré sa petite taille, son intelligence lui permet\nd’affronter sans trembler de grands Pokémon tels que\nles Mackogneur ou les Hariyama.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ungeachtet seines kleinen Wuchses, erweist es sich,\ndank seiner Kampftechnik, gegenüber größeren\nGegnern wie Machomei oder Hariyama als ebenbürtig.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "A pesar de ser un Pokémon de pequeña estatura,\nsu pericia en el combate le permite plantar cara a\nPokémon como Machamp o Hariyama.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nonostante le piccole dimensioni, è in grado di\ntenere testa a Pokémon ben più grandi come\nMachamp o Hariyama.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Although its body is small, its proficient\nfighting skills enable it to keep up with\nbig bruisers like Machamp and Hariyama.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "体格は　小柄だが　カイリキーや\nハリテヤマなど　大きな　ポケモンと\n互角に　戦う　テクニシャン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "A pesar de ser un Pokémon de pequeña estatura,\nsu pericia en el combate le permite plantar cara a\nPokémon como Machamp o Hariyama.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "つばさを　つかい　くうちゅうで\nしせいを　コントロール。ふせぎにくい\nずじょうから　こうげきを　しかける。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "날개를 사용해 공중에서\n자세를 컨트롤한다. 막기 어려운\n머리 위에서부터 공격해온다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il utilise ses ailes pour contrôler avec précision sa\nposture en vol. Ses attaques aériennes sont difficiles\nà parer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es nutzt seine Flügel, um sich am Himmel in Position\nzu halten. Gegen seine Angriffe aus der Luft kann man\nsich nur schwer zur Wehr setzen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Controla su posición en el aire con las alas. Lanza\nataques desde gran altura que resultan difíciles de\nevitar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Grazie alle sue ali riesce a controllare con la massima\nprecisione i movimenti in aria e attacca dall’alto,\nin posizione di vantaggio rispetto ai nemici.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "With its wings, it controls its position in the air.\nIt likes to attack from above, a maneuver that\nis difficult to defend against.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "翼を　使い　空中で　姿勢を\nコントロール。防ぎにくい　頭上から\n攻撃を　仕掛ける。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
