    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "すばやいわざで　あいてを　あっとう。\nひっさつわざを　はなつ　アピールが\nながすぎて　ピンチにおちいることも。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "빠른 기술로 상대를 압도한다.\n필살기를 쓰기 위한 어필이\n너무 길어서 위기에 처하기도 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "用速度快的招式壓倒對手。\n由於使出必殺技時的前置動作太長，\n有時會因此陷入危機。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il terrasse ses adversaires grâce à sa vitesse,\nmais se pavane tant avant de lancer sa botte\nsecrète qu’il se retrouve parfois en difficulté.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es dominiert seine Gegner mit flinken Attacken.\nOft wird es ihm aber zum Verhängnis, dass es\nseine Spezialtechniken zu lange in Szene setzt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Deja atónito al rival con sus rápidos ataques,\npero se luce tanto antes de dar el golpe\ndefinitivo que a veces sale mal parado.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Prevale sul nemico grazie alla sua rapidità, ma a\nvolte per mettersi in mostra aspetta troppo a\nlanciare l’attacco finale e si trova in difficoltà.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It overwhelms opponents with quick moves, but\nsometimes it showboats for too long when it’s\nusing a special move and gets itself into a pinch.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "素早い技で　相手を　圧倒。\n必殺技を　放つ　アピールが\n長すぎて　ピンチに陥ることも。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "用速度快的招式压倒对手。\n使出必杀技时的展示时间过长，\n有时候会陷入危机。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
